{"questions":[{"question_id":"1lg55z3sw","paperTitle":"IIT-JEE 2007 Paper 2 Offline","year":2007,"examDate":2007,"subject":"chemistry","chapter":"biomolecules","chapterGroup":"organic-chemistry","topic":"carbohydrates","type":"mcq","marks":3,"negMarks":1,"permalink":"pstatement-1-glucose-gives-a-reddish-brown-precipitate-wi-jee-advanced-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-dzvilxf8b9laqhvg","content":"<p><b>Statement-1 :</b> Glucose gives a reddish-brown precipitate with Fehling's solution.</p>\n<p><b>Statement-2 :</b> Reaction of glucose with Fehling's solution gives <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.652ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2056 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and gluconic acid.</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"Statement-1 is True, Statement-2 is True; Statement-2 is a correct explanation for Statement-1"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Statement-1 is True, Statement-2 is True; Statement-2 is NOT a correct explanation for Statement-1"},{"identifier":"C","content":"Statement-1 is True, Statement-2 is False"},{"identifier":"D","content":"Statement-1 is False, Statement-2 is True"}],"correct_options":["C"],"explanation":"<p>Fehling's solution contains copper (II) ions complexed with tartrate ions in sodium hydroxide solution. Complexing the copper (II) ions with tartrate ions prevents precipitation of copper (II) hydroxide.</p>\n<p>The reducing group of glucose <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.611ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3806 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1167,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1472,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3417,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is oxidised by the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.048ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.124ex\" height=\"2.09ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -903 2264.7 924\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1311,432.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> ions in Fehling's to <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.048ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.324ex\" height=\"1.958ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -844.3 1911.1 865.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1311,432.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> (red copper oxide).</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1mghtx2sh/b12ab6c6-8662-4542-a496-37cdb8b23b9e/314ddd10-a42f-11f0-beb4-71bca5ea08a4/file-jaoe38c1mghtx2si.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1mghtx2sh/b12ab6c6-8662-4542-a496-37cdb8b23b9e/314ddd10-a42f-11f0-beb4-71bca5ea08a4/file-jaoe38c1mghtx2si.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:baseline\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2007 Paper 2 Offline Chemistry - Biomolecules Question 7 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/jaoe38c1mghtx2sh/b12ab6c6-8662-4542-a496-37cdb8b23b9e/314ddd10-a42f-11f0-beb4-71bca5ea08a4/file-jaoe38c1mghtx2si.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/jaoe38c1mghtx2sh/b12ab6c6-8662-4542-a496-37cdb8b23b9e/314ddd10-a42f-11f0-beb4-71bca5ea08a4/file-jaoe38c1mghtx2si.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1mghtx2sh/b12ab6c6-8662-4542-a496-37cdb8b23b9e/314ddd10-a42f-11f0-beb4-71bca5ea08a4/file-jaoe38c1mghtx2si.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/jaoe38c1mghtx2sh/b12ab6c6-8662-4542-a496-37cdb8b23b9e/314ddd10-a42f-11f0-beb4-71bca5ea08a4/file-jaoe38c1mghtx2si.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/jaoe38c1mghtx2sh/b12ab6c6-8662-4542-a496-37cdb8b23b9e/314ddd10-a42f-11f0-beb4-71bca5ea08a4/file-jaoe38c1mghtx2si.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/jaoe38c1mghtx2sh/b12ab6c6-8662-4542-a496-37cdb8b23b9e/314ddd10-a42f-11f0-beb4-71bca5ea08a4/file-jaoe38c1mghtx2si.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>Red solution is produced due to formation of cuprous oxide. <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.639ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2492.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1311,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1714.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is produced instead of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.652ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2056 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n<p>Hence, statement- 1 is true but statement- 2 is incorrect.</p>"}]}